<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink173-kilavi">
        talaimakaṉ kuṟivaḻicceṉṟu talaimakaḷaikkaṇṭapāṅkaṉ taṉṉuḷḷē colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
          Spoken by the hero to his own heart [when his] male friend saw the heroine on the path of [their earlier] tryst .</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink173">
<l>iravi ṉāṉu miṉṟuyi laṟiyā</l>
<l>taravuṟu tuyara meytupa toṇṭit</l>
<l>taṇṇaṟu neyta ṉāṟum</l>
<l>piṉṉiruṅ kūnta laṇaṅkuṟ ṟōrē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>Those who are tormented [because of she with] braided, black tresses</l>
        <l>That are fragrant with cool, fragrant blue waterlily from Toṇṭi,</l>
        <l>Will obtain the great suffering of the snake [upon losing its gem],</l>
        <l>Not knowing sweet sleep, although it is night.</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
